==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{bor|en|gil|Kiribati}}, from {{der|en|en|Gilberts}} adapted to Gilbertese {{l|en|phonotactics}}, a shortening of {{w|Gilbert Islands}}. First entry in the ''Dictionnaire gilbertin-français'' of {{w|lang=fr|Ernest Sabatier}} (1954).

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|AU}} {{IPA|en|/ˈkɪrəbɑːti/|/ˈkɪrəbæs/}}
* {{a|UK|US}} {{IPA|en|/ˈkiː.ɹɪ.bæs/|/kiː.ɹɪˈbæs/|/ˌkiː.ɹɪˈbɑs/|/ˌkiː.ɹɪˈbɑ.ti/}}
* {{audio|en|en-us-Kiribati.ogg|Audio (US)}}, {{audio|en|en-us-Kiribati-2.ogg|Audio (US)}}

